// Panel: "Live Power per Appliance"  - Gauge, Format as: Table.  OWNER: Part 3
// Latest reading per appliance from the last 2 minutes (ignores the dashboard time range).
// Gauge settings: Value options > Show = All values, Fields = power_w; Unit = Watt; Min 0, Max 2500.
PowerRaw
| where ts > ago(2m)
| summarize arg_max(ts, power_w) by appliance
| project appliance, power_w
